scenario t25_switch
  tally 1
  from 2030-01-01
  over switch
  note "The what-if on the path switch: from tax year 2030 the gains tax is 25 % instead of 19 % (story § The forecast, item 7)."

version gains_25_switch
  cite story
  pit8_rate = 0.25 governs 2030.. "story § The forecast, item 7: from tax year 2030 the gains tax is 25 %"
